,"passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $1,853M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 46.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.59"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":15.82,"default_fair_val":15.82,"premium_pct":467.8,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":28.2,"pe_forward":24.8,"pb_trailing":2.4,"pb_forward":2.2,"div_yield":0.82,"ps_ratio":10.7,"fcf_to_ev":1.92,"fcf_to_mcap":2.35,"liab_to_assets":46.7,"cash_to_assets":0.4,"current_ratio":0.59,"roe":8.5,"roa":4.5,"moat":{"ticker":"CP","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"加拿大太平洋堪薩斯城鐵路 (CPKC) 在鐵路運輸行業中擁有顯著的定價權。其核心業務是提供連接加拿大與美國墨西哥的關鍵運輸服務，這種地理上的獨特性和基礎設施的稀缺性，使得客戶難以找到替代方案。儘管面臨其他鐵路公司和潛在的長途卡車運輸競爭，但鐵路運輸在長距離、大宗貨物的運輸效率和成本上仍具優勢。CPKC 的品牌代表著可靠性和效率，尤其是在其服務的特定市場。然而，定價權並非絕對，仍需受到監管和宏觀經濟因素的影響，因此給予 7 分。","comment_en":"Canadian Pacific Kansas City Railway (CPKC) possesses significant pricing power within the railroad transportation industry. Its core business involves providing critical transport services connecting Canada, the United States, and Mexico. This geographical uniqueness and the scarcity of infrastructure make it difficult for customers to find viable alternatives. While facing competition from other railroads and potentially long-haul trucking, rail transport still holds an advantage in efficiency and cost for long-distance, bulk cargo. CPKC's brand signifies reliability and efficiency, particularly in its specific markets. However, pricing power is not absolute and remains subject to regulatory and macroeconomic influences, hence the score of 7."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"鐵路行業本質上是一個受到嚴格監管的特許經營行業，擁有極高的進入壁壘。CPKC 的營運執照和鐵路線路本身就是一種無形的專利和監管壁壘，新進入者幾乎不可能複製。政府對鐵路網絡的規劃、安全標準和運營許可的嚴格要求，確保了現有營運商的地位。這種監管環境雖然可能限制某些方面的自由度，但也有效地保護了現有企業免受顛覆性競爭的影響，為其提供了穩定的經營環境和近乎壟斷的市場地位，故給予 9 分。","comment_en":"The railroad industry is inherently a highly regulated, franchised business with extremely high barriers to entry. CPKC's operating licenses and rail lines themselves act as intangible patents and regulatory barriers; it is nearly impossible for new entrants to replicate. Strict government requirements for railway network planning, safety standards, and operating permits secure the position of existing operators. While this regulatory environment may limit certain freedoms, it effectively shields incumbent companies from disruptive competition, providing them with a stable operating environment and a near-monopolistic market position, thus earning a score of 9."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"對於依賴鐵路運輸進行大宗商品和長途運輸的客戶而言，轉換到其他運輸方式（如卡車或海運）的成本極高。這不僅涉及物流鏈的重新設計、基礎設施的投資（如裝卸設施），還包括時間成本和潛在的供應鏈中斷風險。CPKC 的網絡覆蓋了關鍵的貿易路線，客戶一旦將其業務整合到 CPKC 的網絡中，就形成了高度的依賴性。這種轉換成本是其維持客戶關係和穩定收入的堅實壁壘，故給予 8 分。","comment_en":"For customers relying on rail transport for bulk commodities and long-distance shipping, the cost of switching to alternative modes (like trucking or maritime) is extremely high. This involves not only redesigning logistics chains and investing in infrastructure (e.g., loading/unloading facilities) but also incurring time costs and potential supply chain disruption risks. CPKC's network covers key trade routes, creating a high degree of dependency once customers integrate their operations into the CPKC network. These switching costs form a solid barrier to maintaining customer relationships and stable revenue, hence the score of 8."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"CPKC 的網絡效應體現在其連接的廣度和效率上。隨著其網絡的擴展（特別是通過收購堪薩斯城南方鐵路），其服務的地理範圍和連接點增加，為更多客戶提供了跨越北美三大經濟體的無縫運輸解決方案。這使得網絡對客戶的價值隨著其規模和連接性的增強而提升。雖然不像社交媒體那樣典型的網絡效應，但鐵路網絡的規模經濟和連接性確實增強了其對客戶的吸引力，形成了一定的正反饋循環，故給予 7 分。","comment_en":"CPKC's network effects are evident in the breadth and efficiency of its connections. With the expansion of its network (particularly through the acquisition of Kansas City Southern Railway), the geographical reach and connection points it serves have increased, offering more customers seamless transportation solutions across the three major North American economies. This enhances the network's value to customers as its scale and connectivity grow. While not as typical as social media network effects, the economies of scale and connectivity of the rail network do strengthen its appeal to customers, creating a positive feedback loop, thus earning a score of 7."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"鐵路運輸在大宗商品和長距離運輸方面具有無可比擬的規模經濟和成本優勢。相較於卡車運輸，單位貨物的運輸成本顯著更低。CPKC 作為北美主要的鐵路營運商之一，其龐大的基礎設施、專用車隊和優化的運營流程，使其能夠以極低的單位成本運營。這種規模帶來的成本優勢是新進入者難以逾越的鴻溝，也是其盈利能力的重要支撐，故給予 9 分。","comment_en":"Rail transport offers unparalleled economies of scale and cost advantages for bulk commodities and long-distance shipping. Compared to trucking, the cost per unit of cargo transported is significantly lower. As one of North America's major railroad operators, CPKC's vast infrastructure, dedicated fleet, and optimized operational processes enable it to operate at extremely low unit costs. This scale-driven cost advantage is a formidable barrier for new entrants and a key pillar of its profitability, hence the score of 9."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"CPKC 擁有獨一無二的地理資產，其鐵路線路橫跨加拿大、美國和墨西哥，形成了連接這三大北美經濟體的關鍵運輸走廊。這種跨國網絡的稀缺性和戰略重要性是其最大的護城河之一。尤其是在後疫情時代，北美區域供應鏈的韌性受到重視，CPKC 的網絡為客戶提供了穩定、高效的跨境運輸解決方案，這是任何競爭對手難以短期內複製或取代的，故給予 9 分。","comment_en":"CPKC possesses unique geographical assets, with its rail lines spanning Canada, the United States, and Mexico, forming a critical transportation corridor connecting these three major North American economies. The scarcity and strategic importance of this cross-border network are among its greatest moats. Especially in the post-pandemic era, the resilience of North American regional supply chains is highly valued, and CPKC's network offers customers stable and efficient cross-border transportation solutions that are difficult for any competitor to replicate or replace in the short term, thus earning a score of 9."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"CPKC 在運營效率方面表現出色，持續優化其鐵路線路、調度系統和車隊管理，以提高貨物週轉速度和降低運營成本。通過採用先進的技術和管理實踐，公司能夠在保證安全的前提下，最大化其基礎設施的利用率。雖然鐵路運營的效率提升空間可能不如某些高科技行業，但 CPKC 在其行業內已屬頂尖水平，持續的效率改進是其維持競爭優勢的關鍵因素，故給予 8 分。","comment_en":"CPKC demonstrates strong operational efficiency, continuously optimizing its rail lines, scheduling systems, and fleet management to increase cargo turnover speed and reduce operating costs. By adopting advanced technologies and management practices, the company maximizes its infrastructure utilization while ensuring safety. Although the scope for efficiency improvements in railroad operations may be less than in some high-tech industries, CPKC is among the top performers within its sector. Continuous efficiency enhancements are a key factor in maintaining its competitive advantage, hence the score of 8."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"歷史上看，CPKC 在資本配置方面表現穩健，能夠在維持基礎設施的同時，通過戰略性收購（如收購堪薩斯城南方鐵路）來擴大網絡和協同效應。公司在回購股票和支付股息方面也相對謹慎，優先考慮能夠產生長期價值的投資。然而，鐵路行業需要持續大量的資本支出以維護和升級基礎設施，這限制了其在其他領域的靈活性。其資本配置策略雖有效，但仍需平衡短期回報與長期基礎設施投入，故給予 7 分。","comment_en":"Historically, CPKC has shown sound capital allocation, balancing infrastructure maintenance with strategic acquisitions (like the purchase of Kansas City Southern Railway) to expand its network and achieve synergies. The company has also been relatively prudent in share buybacks and dividend payments, prioritizing investments that generate long-term value. However, the railroad industry requires continuous, substantial capital expenditures for infrastructure maintenance and upgrades, limiting flexibility in other areas. While its capital allocation strategy is effective, it must balance short-term returns with long-term infrastructure investments, hence the score of 7."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"由於鐵路運輸的基礎設施依賴性和高轉換成本，CPKC 能夠維持非常高的客戶保留率。一旦客戶將其供應鏈與 CPKC 的網絡深度整合，轉換的難度和成本將使其傾向於長期合作。此外，CPKC 作為北美關鍵貿易通道的提供者，其服務的基礎性決定了客戶對其依賴性。公司通過提供可靠、高效的運輸服務來鞏固客戶關係，這種基於基礎設施和服務的客戶忠誠度非常穩固，故給予 8 分。","comment_en":"Due to the infrastructure dependency and high switching costs associated with rail transport, CPKC is able to maintain very high customer retention rates. Once customers deeply integrate their supply chains with CPKC's network, the difficulty and cost of switching make them inclined towards long-term partnerships. Furthermore, as a provider of critical North American trade corridors, the fundamental nature of CPKC's service dictates customer reliance. The company solidifies customer relationships by providing reliable and efficient transportation services, fostering a very stable customer loyalty based on infrastructure and service, thus earning a score of 8."},"m10_durability":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"CPKC 的業務模式具有極強的持久性。鐵路運輸作為現代經濟的基石，其需求相對穩定且不易被顛覆。其龐大的基礎設施網絡、嚴格的監管環境以及高昂的進入壁壘，共同構建了一個難以撼動的護城河。儘管面臨經濟週期波動和行業內競爭，但其核心業務的基礎性保證了其長期生存和發展能力。這種持久性使其成為價值投資者青睞的標的，故給予 9 分。","comment_en":"CPKC's business model exhibits exceptional durability. Railroad transportation, as a cornerstone of the modern economy, faces relatively stable demand and is difficult to disrupt. Its vast infrastructure network, stringent regulatory environment, and high barriers to entry collectively form an unshakeable moat. Despite facing economic cycle fluctuations and industry competition, the fundamental nature of its core business ensures its long-term survival and growth capabilities. This durability makes it a favored asset for value investors, hence the score of 9."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"加拿大太平洋堪薩斯城鐵路 (CPKC) 展現出一個典型的「收費橋」式經濟護城河，其核心競爭力來自於其橫跨北美三大經濟體的獨一無二的鐵路網絡。這種地理上的稀缺性和基礎設施的戰略重要性，加上行業固有的高昂進入壁壘（監管、專利、規模經濟），構成了極其堅固的壁壘。客戶因高昂的轉換成本和網絡的規模效應而高度依賴 CPKC，使其能夠維持穩定的定價權和客戶關係。儘管需要持續的資本投入，但其運營效率和穩健的資本配置能力，進一步鞏固了其持久的競爭優勢。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Canadian Pacific Kansas City Railway (CPKC) exhibits a classic 'toll bridge' economic moat, with its core competitive strength derived from its unique railway network spanning the three major North American economies. This geographical scarcity and the strategic importance of its infrastructure, coupled with the industry's inherent high barriers to entry (regulation, patents, economies of scale), form an extremely robust moat. Customers are highly dependent on CPKC due to high switching costs and the network's economies of scale, enabling it to maintain stable pricing power and customer relationships. Despite requiring continuous capital investment, its operational efficiency and sound capital allocation capabilities further solidify its durable competitive advantage.","evidenceHash":"7c17430629a46b618f9a4789a66a220aa7637b2a6a0990b57adebf2678a1230c","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CAD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"ef0aad4e75ae74bb07e0dde8ee6082b09aaa83f6c11e6b459bed621f14b5602e"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CAD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"ef0aad4e75ae74bb07e0dde8ee6082b09aaa83f6c11e6b459bed621f14b5602e"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CP.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CP.png","website":"https://www.cpkcr.com","ceo":"K